From: Guan Xuetao <gxt@pku.edu.cn>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 13:06:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] DADAO: Add Disassembler for instruction decoding
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Implement DADAODisassembler for bytes → MCInst conversion
- Support all M1 instruction formats: rrii/rrri/rrrr/riii/iiii/rwii/orrr/orri/oiii
- Implement decoder methods: DecodeSImm12/DecodeUImm12/DecodeSImm18/DecodeUImm18/DecodeUImm16/DecodeUImm6/DecodeSImm24/DecodeUImm24/DecodeWydePos
- Register class decoders: DecodeGPRDRegisterClass/DecodeGPRBRegisterClass/DecodeGPRARegisterClass
- Big-endian 32-bit instruction decoding (contract-isa.md §2.1)
- Register disassembler via LLVMInitializeDADAODisassembler
- Add lit test for disassembly verification
- Update DecoderMethod comments: LLVM-008t → LLVM-007t (task renumbering)
